{"4056820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Northgale", "steam_appid": 4056820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4885870], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Northgale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master flight</strong> with your wind-possessed kite. <strong>Restore </strong>its <strong>power </strong>and <strong>return</strong> the <strong>Northwind</strong> to its mountain <strong>throne</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" aria-label=\"Gif of the player looking out over the mystical land\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the wind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the shattered god of the Northwind. What starts as a simple glide will evolve into <strong>mastery over the skies</strong>. Discover <strong>new abilities</strong> to overcome obstacles and conquer previously unreachable locations. Explore the secrets of an <strong>interconnected world</strong> designed for replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" aria-label=\"Gif demonstrating the freedom of flight in Northgale\" width=920 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your own protagonist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the landscape for hidden dyes and patterns. Tailor your protagonist’s look to reflect your journey through majestic fjords and misty forests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" aria-label=\"Gif showcasing the character customization\" width=920 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your puzzle. <strong>Solve wind-based challenges</strong> and navigate treacherous terrain. Use your kite to <strong>manipulate ancient mechanisms</strong>, open gates, and clear the path forward without ever drawing a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/51fd2941ffaf3eb15a3073b4f59e49fa.avif?t=1782497380\" alt=\"Scenery looking out over a forest enviroment\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/51fd2941ffaf3eb15a3073b4f59e49fa.avif?t=1782497380 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Northwind’s uncontrolled powers have thrown the land into chaos. <strong>Solve puzzles &amp; overcome challenges </strong>to return these powers to the source and aid those you meet along the way. Gather resources on your journey to <strong>restore your ruined home</strong>, visually transforming a broken sanctuary into a thriving haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/b646d30d5c42d62643775ed2e1956a29.avif?t=1782497380\" alt=\"Screenshot of homestead building before the storm\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/b646d30d5c42d62643775ed2e1956a29.avif?t=1782497380 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore the north wind's might</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world steeped in <strong>Norwegian folklore</strong>. From lush valleys to frozen peaks, discover a land thrown into chaos. <strong>You carry no weapons, so you must outmaneuver the danger. Dodge hazards, master your flight, and turn the environment against the corruption to reclaim the land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/a4c54d9e15aedb33d3db6269a6b40d66.avif?t=1782497380\" alt=\"Image of a misty pine forest.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/a4c54d9e15aedb33d3db6269a6b40d66.avif?t=1782497380 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Skies:</strong> Physics-based kite flying that evolves as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Adventure:</strong> A cozy exploration with a wholesome narrative to help those in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Norwegian Folklore:</strong> Creatures and narrative deeply rooted in folklore stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Your Home:</strong> Gather resources and rebuild your now ruined home. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize:</strong> Find hidden dyes and patterns to customize your appearance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Northgale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master flight</strong> with your wind-possessed kite. <strong>Restore </strong>its <strong>power </strong>and <strong>return</strong> the <strong>Northwind</strong> to its mountain <strong>throne</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" aria-label=\"Gif of the player looking out over the mystical land\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the wind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the shattered god of the Northwind. What starts as a simple glide will evolve into <strong>mastery over the skies</strong>. Discover <strong>new abilities</strong> to overcome obstacles and conquer previously unreachable locations. Explore the secrets of an <strong>interconnected world</strong> designed for replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" aria-label=\"Gif demonstrating the freedom of flight in Northgale\" width=920 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your own protagonist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the landscape for hidden dyes and patterns. Tailor your protagonist’s look to reflect your journey through majestic fjords and misty forests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" aria-label=\"Gif showcasing the character customization\" width=920 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your puzzle. <strong>Solve wind-based challenges</strong> and navigate treacherous terrain. Use your kite to <strong>manipulate ancient mechanisms</strong>, open gates, and clear the path forward without ever drawing a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/51fd2941ffaf3eb15a3073b4f59e49fa.avif?t=1782497380\" alt=\"Scenery looking out over a forest enviroment\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/51fd2941ffaf3eb15a3073b4f59e49fa.avif?t=1782497380 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Northwind’s uncontrolled powers have thrown the land into chaos. <strong>Solve puzzles &amp; overcome challenges </strong>to return these powers to the source and aid those you meet along the way. Gather resources on your journey to <strong>restore your ruined home</strong>, visually transforming a broken sanctuary into a thriving haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/b646d30d5c42d62643775ed2e1956a29.avif?t=1782497380\" alt=\"Screenshot of homestead building before the storm\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/b646d30d5c42d62643775ed2e1956a29.avif?t=1782497380 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore the north wind's might</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world steeped in <strong>Norwegian folklore</strong>. From lush valleys to frozen peaks, discover a land thrown into chaos. <strong>You carry no weapons, so you must outmaneuver the danger. Dodge hazards, master your flight, and turn the environment against the corruption to reclaim the land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/a4c54d9e15aedb33d3db6269a6b40d66.avif?t=1782497380\" alt=\"Image of a misty pine forest.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/a4c54d9e15aedb33d3db6269a6b40d66.avif?t=1782497380 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Skies:</strong> Physics-based kite flying that evolves as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Adventure:</strong> A cozy exploration with a wholesome narrative to help those in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Norwegian Folklore:</strong> Creatures and narrative deeply rooted in folklore stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Your Home:</strong> Gather resources and rebuild your now ruined home. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize:</strong> Find hidden dyes and patterns to customize your appearance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Harness the spirit of the Northern Wind in this cozy, physics-based exploration adventure. Soar through a hand-painted Nordic landscape with your kite, rescue hidden gnomes, and unlock new flight abilities to restore your ruined homestead. A peaceful journey inspired by Scandinavian folklore.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/370051d5ad7f551e514cca3f34f38d9d6f1fbad1/header.jpg?t=1782497380", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/880f11f11b0a8d6badd2df3fc9517b0ebb9fb2db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782497380", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/880f11f11b0a8d6badd2df3fc9517b0ebb9fb2db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782497380", "website": "https://myteinteractive.no/en/northgale", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 Feature Level AMD or NVIDIA Card with 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD 4-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Myte Interactive"], "publishers": 